PROCSCALEPROBE(1)

NAME
    procscaleprobe - test process scaling and PID uniqueness

SYNOPSIS
    procscaleprobe

DESCRIPTION
    Spawns more than 32 sleeping children, verifies that all returned PIDs are
    unique, waits for every child, and checks that process and PMM accounting
    return close to their starting baseline.

    This probe covers the dynamic scheduler/process-registry path and guards
    against duplicate PID assignment during child churn.

NOTES
    This is primarily a diagnostic or self-test helper, but it is documented so installed programs are discoverable.
